title How It Works

actor Buyer
participant "Escrow\n(smart contract)" as Escrow #E8F5E9
actor Worker

Buyer -> Escrow : create + fund
Worker -> Escrow : submit work
Buyer -> Escrow : approve
Escrow -> Worker : payment released

note over Buyer, Worker
  Optional roles: a **verifier** can review and approve/reject
  before the buyer. An **arbitrator** resolves disputes.
end note

